      <bpmn2:documentation id="documentation_tS0RdQ"><![CDATA[This workflow supports the end-to-end processing of traffic fines in a large enterprise. It covers the receipt of violation notices, identification of the responsible driver, internal approval steps, communication with the issuing authority, and the final settlement or reassignment of liability.]]></bpmn2:documentation>
