  <debug>true</debug>
</split>]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="nammailreceiver" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[panguluri.pslnl333@gmail.com]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="nammailreceivercc" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value/>
        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="nammailreceiverbcc" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value/>
        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="txtmailsubject" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[COMISSION OF TRAFFIC OFFENSE -Requests the payment for <itemvalue>$workflowsummary</itemvalue>]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="rtfmailbody" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[Dear Sir/Madam,

On <itemvalue>fine.violation.date</itemvalue> in <itemvalue>fine.location.description</itemvalue>, the driver of the vehicle with license plate <itemvalue>fine.plate.number</itemvalue> committed a traffic offense endangering road safety as defined in Article 2 of EU Directive 2015/413/EU (<itemvalue>fine.category.name</itemvalue>).
You are registered as the holder of the aforementioned vehicle at the time the traffic offense was committed.
The fine for this traffic offense is <itemvalue>payment.currency</itemvalue><itemvalue>payment.amount</itemvalue> and must be paid within 4 weeks of the date of this letter (via SEPA transfer).

Payment Details:
1. Payee: <itemvalue>payment.bank.name</itemvalue>
2. Penalty amount: <itemvalue>payment.amount</itemvalue>
3. IBAN (SEPA): <itemvalue>payment.dbtr.iban</itemvalue>
4. BIC: <itemvalue>payment.dbtr.bic</itemvalue>
5. Identification number / Payment reference: <itemvalue>payment.reference</itemvalue>
6. Payment deadline: <itemvalue>payment.duedate</itemvalue>

Note: If the fine is paid within the deadline, no penalty proceedings will be initiated against either you or the actual driver of the vehicle. The traffic offense will not be pursued further, and no notification will be sent to other authorities.

Best regards.

]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
      </bpmn2:extensionElements>
